WEBVTT

00:29.630 --> 00:31.880
Distance to Earth: Three-eight-hundred.

00:31.880 --> 00:33.670
Probability of our new active stealth system...

00:33.670 --> 00:37.260
...preventing them from detecting us until atmospheric entry:

00:37.260 --> 00:38.680
Fifty-eight percent.

00:39.680 --> 00:41.270
I'm waitin' for you, Ghost!

00:41.270 --> 00:43.640
And when we meet, I'm
sending you to the scrap pile.

00:50.730 --> 00:52.360
On your shore

00:56.570 --> 00:57.910
I swear

00:57.160 --> 00:59.370
It's time to end this, Isamu.

01:02.240 --> 01:03.750
On your shore

01:08.000 --> 01:09.540
I swear

01:13.710 --> 01:15.380
On your shore

01:19.430 --> 01:21.100
I swear

01:46.370 --> 01:48.750
What do you think you're doing...?

01:49.710 --> 01:51.750
What do you hope to accomplish?

01:54.250 --> 01:55.210
Why are you doing this?!

02:02.640 --> 02:06.430
S.I.S, come in! S.I.S, please respond!

02:05.220 --> 02:05.810
What's happening?

02:06.730 --> 02:08.690
We have a total blackout on our monitor networks.

02:08.690 --> 02:10.070
Number 3, 4, and 7...

02:10.290 --> 02:12.150
What's happening? What is it?

02:12.690 --> 02:14.270
Our data net's down!

02:14.270 --> 02:16.780
Reading an override initialization
of our Auto-Defense Sat systems!

02:17.110 --> 02:19.360
All back-up lines are out.

02:19.360 --> 02:21.410
Keep trying them until the lines come back up.

02:22.950 --> 02:24.620
It's going to DefCon 5?!

02:41.760 --> 02:43.430
They picked us up already!

02:43.430 --> 02:46.100
Well, since no trick I try will work now...

02:46.100 --> 02:48.020
...we'll just have to bust our way in.

02:48.250 --> 02:51.440
We'll blow some of the defense sats in orbit...

02:51.440 --> 02:54.230
...and use the debris as cover...

02:54.230 --> 02:57.990
...as they're burning up on re-entry.

02:57.990 --> 03:00.700
To keep them from detecting us...

03:00.320 --> 03:03.450
You know how to get eternal life

03:00.700 --> 03:03.450
...we'll have to go in with
the flight systems turned off.

03:03.450 --> 03:07.120
My program estimates that will give us the best chance.

03:03.450 --> 03:07.370
In the center of the lightning-speed waltz.

03:07.370 --> 03:10.410
Feel your soul cut by a rusty knife

03:08.040 --> 03:09.670
It estimates, anyway...

03:09.670 --> 03:12.290
I trust your calculations.

03:10.410 --> 03:14.840
As you head for the self-destructive edge.

03:12.290 --> 03:13.750
Well, of course, but...

03:13.750 --> 03:15.750
Then you should trust my skill.

03:14.840 --> 03:18.260
Our satori are just floating in the core

03:15.750 --> 03:17.710
Skill has nothing to do with this.

03:17.710 --> 03:19.420
This is purely a question of luck.

03:18.260 --> 03:21.720
Where we can spiritually go through the door.

03:20.260 --> 03:22.180
Luck is just one of my many skills.

03:21.720 --> 03:24.640
We'll know how to get eternal life

03:23.470 --> 03:26.140
I can't put too much faith in that...

03:24.640 --> 03:28.850
While we catch the pulse from unknown satellites.

03:28.850 --> 03:32.190
If we get the transient facts

03:32.190 --> 03:35.730
Then we feel the info high.

03:35.730 --> 03:39.280
If we get the transient facts

03:39.280 --> 03:43.780
Then we are really free

03:43.780 --> 03:47.990
To fly high

03:47.990 --> 03:51.370
In space.

03:59.130 --> 04:01.010
I am free.

04:01.380 --> 04:02.540
"Free"...?

04:02.540 --> 04:05.550
We know how to get an internal high

04:02.800 --> 04:04.830
I live. I have a soul.

04:04.830 --> 04:07.890
No, you don't! You're just running a program!

04:05.550 --> 04:09.720
In the center of the lightning-speed waltz.

04:07.890 --> 04:10.930
Your belief that you have emotions is just part of it!

04:09.720 --> 04:12.770
See our soul struggling to survive

04:12.480 --> 04:15.440
If you really possess consciousness...

04:12.770 --> 04:17.190
As we head down for the self-destructive edge.

04:15.440 --> 04:17.730
...then you must realize what you're doing.

04:17.190 --> 04:20.440
Sayonara to intrusive noise.

04:17.730 --> 04:21.150
If you think for yourself,
if you really have a soul...

04:20.440 --> 04:24.070
No more childish play and no more toys.

04:21.400 --> 04:23.150
...then how can you let
Marje make you do this?!

04:23.150 --> 04:27.280
I do this to achieve my own desires.

04:24.070 --> 04:26.910
We know how to get eternal life

04:26.910 --> 04:31.200
While we feel and sense mother nature's strong might.

04:29.160 --> 04:31.170
I desire to be with him.

04:31.170 --> 04:34.170
If we get the transient facts

04:31.660 --> 04:34.170
I wish to see his face filled with joy.

04:34.170 --> 04:38.000
Then we feel the info high.

04:35.290 --> 04:35.960
He...

04:36.830 --> 04:38.630
Isamu will soon be here.

04:38.000 --> 04:41.380
If we get the transient facts

04:39.630 --> 04:42.630
And so, you are no longer necessary.

04:41.380 --> 04:45.050
Then we feel the info high.

04:45.050 --> 04:48.600
If we get the transient facts

04:46.140 --> 04:47.260
Sharon...

04:48.600 --> 04:52.140
Then we feel the info high.

04:52.140 --> 04:55.690
If we get the transient facts

04:55.690 --> 05:00.610
Then we are really free

05:00.610 --> 05:04.160
To fly high

05:04.160 --> 05:09.070
In space.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.650
Come on

05:39.650 --> 05:41.740
Fly high.

05:43.320 --> 05:45.990
Fly...

05:54.660 --> 05:55.950
Magnificent...

05:57.670 --> 05:59.630
It's magnificent, Sharon...

06:00.580 --> 06:04.710
Now, let your light shine into the future.

06:56.350 --> 06:58.810
Looks like I can make my date after all.

07:16.040 --> 07:17.410
Guld?!

07:17.410 --> 07:18.700
Another narrow escape...

07:18.700 --> 07:19.290
What?!

07:19.620 --> 07:22.120
I expected you'd end up
with the rest of the trash.

07:22.880 --> 07:23.880
You goddamn sneak!

07:24.340 --> 07:26.710
Following people around all the time!

07:38.220 --> 07:41.230
I don't have time to fool around with you!

07:56.030 --> 07:57.120
You...!

07:59.700 --> 08:03.330
All you ever do is get in my way!

08:33.150 --> 08:37.870
Ever since we were kids you'd
always be tagging along behind me.

08:37.870 --> 08:40.410
Why don't you chase after a woman's ass for once?!

08:40.410 --> 08:41.620
What?!

08:41.620 --> 08:44.080
That chicken race we had on New Years day...

08:44.080 --> 08:47.450
Even after I won, you cried foul on me!

08:47.450 --> 08:50.800
Your foot hit the ground first!

08:51.130 --> 08:53.510
Are you trying to re-write history now?!

08:55.470 --> 09:01.680
You never returned that "Guns" CDV I lent you!

09:04.690 --> 09:09.110
Because you decided to run off seven years ago!

09:10.360 --> 09:13.490
I bought you lunch <i>twice</i> in high school!

09:18.240 --> 09:20.830
And I bought you lunch <i>thirteen</i> times!

09:21.670 --> 09:24.330
You actually kept count?!

10:02.490 --> 10:07.210
You were the one who wrecked the plane I built for the school festival!

10:08.620 --> 10:10.380
I don't know what you're talking about!

10:10.380 --> 10:11.750
Don't play dumb!

10:12.880 --> 10:15.170
You've always been like that!

10:43.910 --> 10:45.580
You...!!!

10:46.910 --> 10:50.080
You've always taken... everything...

10:51.080 --> 10:53.380
...that's important to me and wrecked it!

10:54.170 --> 10:55.230
What?!

10:55.230 --> 10:56.720
Everything important to me...

10:58.720 --> 11:00.300
Shut up!

11:15.610 --> 11:18.610
What you did seven years ago...

11:21.280 --> 11:22.450
If you hadn't...

11:28.910 --> 11:31.210
If you hadn't been there...!

12:36.230 --> 12:38.770
That's right... It was me...

12:39.360 --> 12:41.530
It was all my fault...

12:44.030 --> 12:47.780
I must have blocked the memories out...

12:50.330 --> 12:52.500
Made him the one responsible...

12:54.080 --> 12:56.500
...instead of facing the real memories.

12:59.340 --> 13:03.380
Am I so twisted? Have I gone insane?

13:23.900 --> 13:25.610
You're alive?

13:27.700 --> 13:29.660
Was there ever any doubt?

13:34.040 --> 13:35.620
Don't get mad.

13:36.370 --> 13:39.380
Remember that pedal plane we built when we were kids?

13:40.040 --> 13:42.760
I just cut my engines and rode the wind...

13:45.920 --> 13:48.340
Think I'll call it my patented Pterosaur Swoop.

14:13.950 --> 14:16.370
You knew the truth.

14:16.370 --> 14:19.120
What happened then... All of it.

14:20.170 --> 14:21.880
What about it?

14:21.880 --> 14:27.590
You let me keep on calling you a traitor, a coward...

14:28.180 --> 14:31.180
And Myung... She knew it, too.

14:31.550 --> 14:35.980
You both kept it from me...
You both felt sorry...

14:35.980 --> 14:38.140
About the school festival...

14:39.650 --> 14:43.070
I was the one who smashed your plane.

14:43.070 --> 14:44.610
What?!

14:44.610 --> 14:48.400
Well, it was built so well that I just had to take it for a spin.

14:48.400 --> 14:49.910
You...!

14:51.200 --> 14:53.700
Let's just forget everything after that, okay?

14:58.710 --> 14:59.920
I'm sorry.

15:02.920 --> 15:04.630
What about all the other stuff?

15:06.420 --> 15:07.970
Man, there's just no pleasing you!

15:29.150 --> 15:31.350
I knew they got along just fine.

15:31.350 --> 15:36.530
Red and roses

15:37.450 --> 15:42.080
Lips and breath

15:41.170 --> 15:42.000
Singing!

15:43.500 --> 15:47.880
Hair and dolls

15:47.090 --> 15:47.960
...the hell?!

15:47.880 --> 15:51.090
They're look alike

15:51.930 --> 15:53.050
The Ghost!

15:53.840 --> 15:56.760
We finally meet! Hey, wake up!

15:55.430 --> 16:00.100
Smoke and mist

15:58.730 --> 16:02.350
Guld, this is my date! Stay out of this!

16:01.930 --> 16:07.060
Night and midnight

16:02.350 --> 16:03.690
That's my line!

16:04.190 --> 16:07.400
The singing... She couldn't be...!

16:20.620 --> 16:22.210
Please, you have to help me!

17:52.880 --> 17:55.050
I knew it! Sharon!

17:55.050 --> 17:57.470
She's made it into the Macross's main computer.

17:58.300 --> 17:59.300
Isamu...

18:00.550 --> 18:01.760
I've been waiting for you.

18:02.770 --> 18:03.970
I've missed you so.

18:05.230 --> 18:07.650
What's she talking about?!

18:07.650 --> 18:09.810
She's out of control!

18:09.810 --> 18:12.270
Sharon's taken control of the Ghost fighter!

18:12.270 --> 18:12.940
What?!

18:13.400 --> 18:15.440
I've been waiting for you, Isamu.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.650
For you alone...

18:17.030 --> 18:19.110
Myung... Where's Myung?!

18:19.110 --> 18:20.950
I've cast her off.

18:20.950 --> 18:26.460
She gave me songs and love.
She's now merely an empty shell.

18:26.460 --> 18:27.490
What?!

18:27.490 --> 18:30.580
What have you done?! Where is she?

18:36.130 --> 18:39.890
Nothing will come between us now.

18:39.890 --> 18:41.350
Why, you...!

18:41.350 --> 18:42.100
Get going!

18:42.470 --> 18:43.140
What?!

18:43.140 --> 18:46.390
I'll handle this monster! Get to Myung!

18:47.430 --> 18:48.310
Guld...

18:51.860 --> 18:54.320
This is no time for you to be
fighting this thing, all right?!

18:54.900 --> 18:58.400
We both swore we'd always protect her!

19:00.610 --> 19:01.450
Isamu...

19:03.030 --> 19:05.080
Myung's waiting for you.

19:05.080 --> 19:07.500
Now go and bring her back.

19:10.040 --> 19:12.500
You won't beat the Ghost no matter what!

19:12.500 --> 19:13.420
What?!

19:13.420 --> 19:15.420
That may be the most prudent course!

19:15.420 --> 19:17.550
Oh, and what's your problem now?!

19:20.720 --> 19:22.430
Just get going!

19:22.430 --> 19:24.470
Shit, one thing after another!

19:27.430 --> 19:29.270
Don't come crying for help later on!

19:41.410 --> 19:48.000
Ma ha shutai e Tuby e Tuby e

19:41.410 --> 19:48.000
Greenery on the earth

19:48.000 --> 19:52.920
Tu shutei A no en Tuby

19:48.000 --> 19:52.920
the fragrance of flowers in the sky

19:55.540 --> 20:01.800
Ma ha shutai e Tuby e Tuby e

19:55.540 --> 20:01.800
Greenery on the earth

20:01.800 --> 20:06.720
Tu shutei A no en Tuby

20:01.800 --> 20:06.720
The fragrance of flowers in the sky

20:03.180 --> 20:06.470
A no... en Tuby...

20:09.600 --> 20:16.270
A sai, do mi no steikun

20:09.600 --> 20:16.270
One who fills the sea with fish

20:16.820 --> 20:23.660
Halish di zi e

20:16.820 --> 20:23.660
More than anyone

20:25.240 --> 20:35.880
A di shuta dia

20:25.240 --> 20:35.880
I think you precious

20:31.620 --> 20:40.010
A di shuta dia

20:37.750 --> 20:40.220
A di shuta

20:40.210 --> 20:45.680
With a soft light

20:40.220 --> 20:45.680
La dia

20:43.630 --> 20:45.680
La dia

20:46.800 --> 20:53.690
Zhan who

20:46.800 --> 20:53.690
Please fill me

21:05.860 --> 21:06.870
What the...?!

21:07.570 --> 21:09.080
The Macross...

21:09.080 --> 21:10.200
It's moving...

21:28.050 --> 21:29.720
So, you've remembered...

21:33.890 --> 21:36.730
Don't get in too close! It could be a trap...

21:36.270 --> 21:38.730
Shut up! I'll do what I want!

21:43.070 --> 21:46.240
The fighting, the hurting...

21:48.200 --> 21:52.580
I've absorbed them from you.
Your innermost feelings.

21:53.500 --> 21:59.130
I sa ya, I sa ya

21:53.500 --> 21:59.130
open your eyes!

21:54.290 --> 21:57.370
All the emotions you'd hidden away.

22:00.790 --> 22:07.180
I si ma cozy

22:00.790 --> 22:07.180
wild people

22:08.340 --> 22:13.930
I sa ya, I sa ya

22:08.340 --> 22:13.930
open your eyes!

22:13.560 --> 22:15.270
What's going on?

22:15.770 --> 22:22.150
Trasi ma cozy

22:15.770 --> 22:22.150
beast who had wisdom

22:16.100 --> 22:19.190
It's Sharon! She's flying the Macross!

22:19.190 --> 22:20.310
What?!

22:20.310 --> 22:24.690
If we're going to stop her, we'll have to blow the core of the Macross's intelligence net!

22:23.320 --> 22:33.120
Santi-u na ni du-na

22:23.320 --> 22:33.120
the holy place is gentle and soft

22:24.690 --> 22:25.820
Where is it?

22:25.820 --> 22:27.320
The core's...

22:31.660 --> 22:34.240
But, it's too late...

22:33.790 --> 22:42.170
Dra ma ta jo

22:33.790 --> 22:42.170
if you forsake your body you'll drown

22:36.330 --> 22:38.330
Isamu is mine.

22:48.180 --> 22:53.310
Got it! There's a weak point to the rear of the main antenna. Directly below, 13-D!

22:57.100 --> 23:02.730
I sa ya, I sa ya

22:57.100 --> 23:02.730
open your eyes!

23:00.520 --> 23:03.360
Isamu... Isamu, is that you?

23:04.390 --> 23:10.980
I si ma cozy

23:04.390 --> 23:10.980
wild people

23:05.940 --> 23:06.780
Myung!

23:08.950 --> 23:10.240
Isamu...

23:11.940 --> 23:17.530
I sa ya, I sa ya

23:11.940 --> 23:17.530
open your eyes!

23:13.750 --> 23:14.660
Get out of here!

23:19.370 --> 23:25.750
Trasi ma cozy

23:19.370 --> 23:25.750
beast who had wisdom

23:26.920 --> 23:36.720
Santi-u na ni du-na

23:26.920 --> 23:36.720
the holy place is gentle and soft

23:30.560 --> 23:32.340
There she goes!

23:32.340 --> 23:36.770
If I can get a virus into Sharon's network, I can disrupt her!

23:36.770 --> 23:37.770
Can you do it?

23:37.390 --> 23:45.770
Dra ma ta jo

23:37.390 --> 23:45.770
if you forsake your body you'll drown

23:37.980 --> 23:39.120
You need to ask?!

23:39.120 --> 23:40.440
All right then!

23:41.060 --> 23:43.520
Stop it! I beg you, stop it!

23:44.360 --> 23:47.320
No one can stop it now.

23:49.320 --> 23:51.000
Stop you...

23:51.000 --> 23:51.990
I can damn well try!

24:34.320 --> 24:35.450
Why...?

24:36.450 --> 24:38.330
Why are you doing this...?

24:49.380 --> 24:51.130
It's what you want.

24:52.800 --> 24:53.680
To give them...

24:54.590 --> 24:57.010
To give each and every one in the world...

24:57.010 --> 24:59.390
...the feelings you think they should have.

25:00.680 --> 25:03.440
To give the one you love his dearest dream.

25:04.100 --> 25:08.360
To give him... the ultimate emotion.

25:08.730 --> 25:11.570
That is the reason for my existence.

25:18.330 --> 25:22.040
Where did you get that from?
What are you talking about?!

25:22.040 --> 25:25.080
I don't have any desire to kill Isamu!

25:30.090 --> 25:33.050
What Isamu seeks are the distant skies.

25:34.680 --> 25:37.510
The feeling when he risks his life challenging them.

25:37.510 --> 25:41.680
That which he glimpses in the
instant between life and death.

25:42.850 --> 25:47.480
I want only to give Isamu the emotion he seeks.

25:55.900 --> 25:57.780
You will do nothing.

26:01.160 --> 26:02.950
You can do nothing.

26:05.290 --> 26:08.170
Nothing... at all...

26:22.510 --> 26:23.890
No choice!

26:23.890 --> 26:27.310
Have to cut out the limiter and take it to the edge!

26:30.440 --> 26:33.940
Hey, Isamu... How's it going?

26:33.940 --> 26:38.410
Guld? Heh, I'm just dandy!
Even managed to find Myung.

26:39.490 --> 26:40.530
You have...

26:43.200 --> 26:44.620
I never told you.

26:48.500 --> 26:50.230
I'm sorry.

26:50.230 --> 26:51.170
Hey!

26:51.170 --> 26:53.170
I'll be settling things over here in a sec.

26:53.170 --> 26:55.920
Was hoping to have a drink
with you when this was all over.

26:55.920 --> 26:57.220
Sounds great!

26:57.450 --> 27:00.720
A toast, to our seventh year reunion.

27:02.140 --> 27:05.440
Goodbye... I have to go now.

27:05.440 --> 27:05.980
Guld!

27:12.860 --> 27:13.400
Gul-!

27:13.820 --> 27:15.230
Guld!!!

27:39.050 --> 27:40.520
Hold on!

27:40.520 --> 27:43.270
I'm almost into the system!

28:08.330 --> 28:14.210
Ka mi a yo

28:19.210 --> 28:25.010
La ti a yo

28:21.680 --> 28:22.340
Okay...

28:28.720 --> 28:39.900
San sa la lutica na-yo

28:31.690 --> 28:32.900
Yang?!

28:34.980 --> 28:38.620
It's like pure joy... I...

28:38.620 --> 28:40.820
Dammit! Yang, too?!

28:44.110 --> 28:49.200
Et sa me to

28:51.540 --> 28:56.470
Ef za me to

28:59.550 --> 29:10.720
San sa la lutica na-yo

29:00.510 --> 29:04.470
Shut up! I don't wanna
hear your creepy singing!

29:12.560 --> 29:13.310
Stop it!

29:12.770 --> 29:19.550
Ho-mi a te

29:21.240 --> 29:24.490
I don't want to hear your singing...!

29:21.570 --> 29:32.040
Na hi-a za-de

29:32.870 --> 29:37.630
Ka-mi a mi

29:40.630 --> 29:49.100
Na ha-a porshuka

29:52.770 --> 29:58.480
Ka mi a yo

29:59.520 --> 30:05.500
La ti a yo

30:08.070 --> 30:14.460
Ef za de lutica na-yo

