hitotsume no kotoba wa yume nemuri no naka kara

32:52.790 --> 33:05.580
The first word was "dream", it came to me as I slept.

33:07.290 --> 33:19.220
mune no oku no kurayami wo sotto tsuredasu no

33:07.290 --> 33:19.220
Gently bringing out the darkness deep inside my heart.

33:21.560 --> 33:34.280
futatsume no kotoba wa kaze yukute wo oshiete

33:21.560 --> 33:34.280
The second word was "wind", show me the way...

33:35.490 --> 33:47.630
kamisama no ude no naka e tsubasa wo aoru no

33:35.490 --> 33:47.630
I beat my wings towards the embrace of the gods.

33:48.380 --> 34:01.310
tokete itta kanashii koto wo kazoeru you ni

33:48.380 --> 34:01.310
As if counting the sorrows that have melted all away...

34:02.310 --> 34:09.980
kin'iro no ringo ga

34:02.310 --> 34:09.980
The golden apples fall...

34:10.690 --> 34:15.650
mata hitotsu ochiru

34:10.690 --> 34:15.650
Falling one at a time...

34:17.280 --> 34:30.000
mita koto mo nai fuukei soko ga kaeru basho

34:17.280 --> 34:30.000
To a place with nothing to see is where I must return.

34:30.960 --> 34:43.020
A place I have only one life to struggle to get back to.

34:52.360 --> 34:59.370
An old book of magic spells...

35:02.330 --> 35:10.710
The curtain of the silent moonlit night holds...

35:10.710 --> 35:24.600
... only the promise of our being together again.

35:25.390 --> 35:32.060
We can fly. We have wings.

35:32.060 --> 35:38.700
We can touch floating dreams.

35:38.700 --> 35:45.290
Call me from so far...

35:45.290 --> 35:53.420
Through the wind in the light.

36:00.430 --> 36:07.100
mittsume no kotoba wa hum...

36:00.430 --> 36:07.100
The third word that came was hmm...

36:08.390 --> 36:13.770
mimi wo sumashitara

36:08.390 --> 36:13.770
If I can just listen closely...

36:15.940 --> 36:23.450
anata no furueru ude wo

36:15.940 --> 36:23.490
These trembling arms of yours that I hold...

36:23.490 --> 36:30.120
sotto tokihanatsu

36:23.490 --> 36:30.120
...I can gently set free.
